<title>UK: Key points from BCC quarterly UK economic survey.</title>
<headline>Key points from BCC quarterly UK economic survey.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the key findings from the British Chambers of Commerce (BCC) economic survey for the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>The BCC survey covers 8,639 British companies in both services and manufacturing.</p>
<p>All figures are expressed as a percentage balance, except categories asterisked, which show a pure percentage.</p>
<p>						 Q4 1996     Q3 1996</p>
<p>MANUFACTURING</p>
<p>Were domestic deliveries</p>
<p> up over the past 3 months?		25	    25</p>
<p>Were export deliveries up</p>
<p> over the past 3 months?		   24	    27</p>
<p>Do you expect to increase</p>
<p> workforce in the next 3 months?	  6	    19</p>
<p>Have you experienced difficulties</p>
<p> in recruiting staff in last 3 mths?*  75	    64</p>
<p>Have you revised up investment</p>
<p>plans for plant and machinery</p>
<p> in past three months?		     18	    22</p>
<p>Will turnover improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			     61	    62</p>
<p>Will profitability improve in</p>
<p> next 12 month?				48	    45</p>
<p>Is your firm operating at</p>
<p> full capacity?*			     35	    42</p>
<p>Has your cash flow improved in</p>
<p> the last three months?		    13	    11</p>
<p>SERVICES</p>
<p>Were domestic deliveries</p>
<p> up over the past 3 mths?		  42	    38</p>
<p>Were export deliveries up</p>
<p> over the past 3 months?		   31	    26</p>
<p>Do you expect to increase</p>
<p> workforce in the next 3 mths?	   16	    22</p>
<p>Have you experienced difficulties</p>
<p> in recruiting staff in last 3 mths?*  62	    57</p>
<p>Have you revised up investment</p>
<p>plans for plant and machinery</p>
<p> in past three months?		     24	    21</p>
<p>Will turnover improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			     64	    57</p>
<p>Will profitability improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			     51	    45</p>
<p>Is your firm operating at</p>
<p> full capacity?*			     47	    46</p>
<p>Has your cash flow improved in</p>
<p> the last three months?		    19	    13</p>
<p>-- Rosemary Bennett +44 171 542 7715</p>
